+- No deploy/restart/config mutation from the agent plane (#2211's own operator-policy note stands).
+- No re-file of the finding (this receipt refs #2211; the auditor's issue stays the single SSOT for the deploy-plane failure).
+- No new sentry generation filed this cycle (gen-8 #2201 landed 16:49Z in-window; zero-duplicate held — the telegram incident above is recorded HERE and belongs to gen-9's sweep).
+- Agents never treat empty-body + error=False as data (failure-mode recipe above).
